The kingdom-tactics-engine folder contains the core game engine implementation for a TypeScript-based strategy game, providing isomorphic functionality that can run both in Node.js and browser environments. It serves as the foundational backend system that handles game logic, rules, and state management for kingdom-building and tactical gameplay mechanics. This folder acts as the central hub for all game engine operations, with configuration files managing TypeScript compilation, testing setup, and project dependencies to ensure consistent cross-platform functionality.
